{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01934",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.95,
      "end_seconds": 4.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "hello, doctor i think it's my turn"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.33,
      "end_seconds": 9.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.85,
      "end_seconds": 19.94,
      "duration_seconds": 9.09,
      "text": "Actually, honestly, it's a tingling lip then a blister, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.89,
      "end_seconds": 23.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.12,
      "end_seconds": 35.52,
      "duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "text": "It's been going on for two days. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I've also had a mild sore feeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.48,
      "end_seconds": 41.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.45,
      "end_seconds": 54.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.82,
      "end_seconds": 75.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 78, pressure 108 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.2,
      "end_seconds": 79.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.93,
      "end_seconds": 86.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.55,
      "end_seconds": 92.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.58,
      "end_seconds": 96.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.17,
      "end_seconds": 115.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "There is a small cluster of blisters on the edge of the upper lip."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.5,
      "end_seconds": 128.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.51,
      "end_seconds": 140.12,
      "duration_seconds": 8.61,
      "text": "Okay, that's all I needed to check. And what about sores in the mouth, eye pain, fever or rash elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.82,
      "end_seconds": 148.36,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "text": "No sores in the mouth, eye pain, fever or rash elsewhere, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.08,
      "end_seconds": 152.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.32,
      "end_seconds": 158.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.43,
      "end_seconds": 163.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.65,
      "end_seconds": 175.73,
      "duration_seconds": 10.08,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. My partner and our baby. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.4,
      "end_seconds": 179.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.68,
      "end_seconds": 184.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.38,
      "end_seconds": 190.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.85,
      "end_seconds": 199.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "It's, It's omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day for the reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.92,
      "end_seconds": 212.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.35,
      "end_seconds": 216.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Yes, acid reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.41,
      "end_seconds": 231.58,
      "duration_seconds": 14.17,
      "text": "Sure. Yes, acid reflux is known to us, good to have that clear. From what you've told me and what I found, the most likely explanation is a cold sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.54,
      "end_seconds": 257.46,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "I'd like you to take aciclovir cream, 5%, five times a day, five days. It's for cold sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.64,
      "end_seconds": 259.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Mm, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.67,
      "end_seconds": 278.06,
      "duration_seconds": 17.39,
      "text": "Avoid kissing and sharing towels until it has crusted over. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. We'll catch up if not healed in ten days. So, how would you describe the plan, so we're on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.05,
      "end_seconds": 291.01,
      "duration_seconds": 11.96,
      "text": "so, um, I take the aciclovir cream, 5%, five times a day and come back if not healed in ten days is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.08,
      "end_seconds": 298.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.52,
      "end_seconds": 302.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}